       "q": "Are Vape products tested in Massachusetts?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p>Yes, all Vape products available on Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleets vape menu have been tested and meet strict Massachusetts state testing requirements. </p>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "q": "What’s the difference between live resin and distillate?",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "rich",
         "html": "<p> Live resin preserves more terpenes for better flavor, while distillate focuses on high THC potency. You can find both variety of products on the Cape Cod Cannabis menu. Speak with a team member to determine the best vape near me for you. </p>",
         "dev": []
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "q": "Do disposable Vapes need charging?",
       "blocks": [
        {
