  {
   "n": 11,
   "id": "d065de1",
   "doc": "wp-post#120796",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "faq",
     "kind": "nested-accordion",
     "items": [
      {
       "q": "CLICK TO VIEW CANNABIS VAPE FAQ'S",
       "blocks": [
        {
         "t": "faq",
         "kind": "nested-accordion",
         "items": [
          {
           "q": "Are Vape products tested in Massachusetts?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Yes, all Vape products available on the Cape Cod Cannabis menu have been tested and meet strict Massachusetts state testing requirements. </p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "What’s the difference between live resin and distillate?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "heading",
             "level": 4,
             "text": "What is Live Resin (in vapes)?"
            },
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Live resin vape oil is made from freshly harvested plants that are frozen right away to preserve natural flavor and aroma. The extraction process captures a wide range of compounds, resulting in <strong>richer flavor, stronger aroma, and a more full-spectrum experience</strong>. Live resin cartridges are often chosen by those who value taste and a true-to-plant profile.</p>"
            },
            {
             "t": "heading",
             "level": 4,
             "text": "What is Distillate (in vapes)?"
            },
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p>Distillate vape oil is refined to isolate specific compounds, creating a <strong>highly purified, consistent oil</strong>. It typically has very little natural flavor on its own, so flavor profiles are often added. Distillate cartridges are popular for their <strong>potency, smooth vapor, and reliability</strong>, making them a great everyday option.</p><p>You can find both variety of products on the Cape Cod Cannabis menu. Speak with a team member to determine the best vape near me for you. </p>"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "q": "Do disposable Vapes need charging?",
           "blocks": [
            {
             "t": "rich",
             "html": "<p> Some are rechargeable, while others are single-use—details are listed on each product. You can find both disposable and cartridges on the Cape Cod Cannabis menu. Speak with a team member to determine the best disposable vape near me for you. </p>"
            }
           ]
          }
         ],
